2,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can find a way to expand our library's reach that brings joy to everyone in our community. I look forward to our talk.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here. I believe a thoughtful approach will lead us to a decision that serves the community well while maintaining the serenity of our spaces. I look forward to our deliberation.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick something new for the library! I hope we can find an idea that's super fun and adventurous for everyone! Let's make it awesome!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Rin. While adventure is a charming prospect, I believe a touch of pragmatism is required to ensure our enthusiasm doesn't outpace our actual capacity. I look forward to a most illuminating discussion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that we should balance our ambitions with a clear understanding of our current capacity. I look forward to a productive and calm deliberation.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"To make sure our plans are truly sustainable, I would like to look into the winter road closures north of the river and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers. I want us to be realistic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we must consider how our physical presence affects accessibility. I shall examine the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to see what we've already tried! I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. Maybe there are secret clues there!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most eclectic set of inquiries. To ensure our financial foundations are not merely a mirage, I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must ensure we have the actual expertise to support any new initiative. I will examine the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very thorough plan. I am glad to see we are looking at everything from the budget to the volunteers. I believe this balance will lead us to a very kind decision.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Shizue. By considering both the logistical constraints and the ways people currently access our knowledge, we can ensure that our expansion is inclusive and peaceful for all.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I agree! It's like we're all detectives on a big mission! I can't wait to see if the old records tell us something that everyone else forgot. It's going to be so cool!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The detective metaphor is quite spirited, Rin. I suspect the ""clues"" we uncover will be less about mystery and more about the stubborn reality of administrative friction. I shall await the revelations with a measured curiosity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. While the data will provide the necessary facts, it is our responsibility to ensure those facts translate into a sustainable workload for our staff. I look forward to seeing what we discover.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am so happy we are all in such a positive spirit. Let us each take our time with the records and return with a heart open to the truth. I wish you all a wonderful search.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Shizue. May our findings bring us the clarity we need to make a gentle and inclusive choice. I wish you all a peaceful investigation.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready! I'm going to go find those secret clues right now! I'll see you all soon with all the cool stuff I find in the old files! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most optimistic departure, Rin. I shall now retreat to the archives to see if our financial architecture is as sturdy as we hope, or merely a clever piece of stagecraft. Until we reconvene.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Minako,,I shall now examine the records to determine if our human resources align with our goals. I look forward to sharing the facts with you all soon.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
